### outside pass: contents, unsplit
# src/engine/prefix/mod.rs:538-618 prefill_with_cache_mode; examples/prefix_solve.rs:97-103
#   prefix probe (prefix_solve.rs:98, then prefix/mod.rs:558)  -> before the allocation
#   decode_state(total_cap)          -> 421 MB KV state: 1 zeroed plane + 55 KvPlane::clone()s
#                                       = 56 planes (28 K + 28 V); attn.rs:184-189, 988-1056
#   prefill_state_with_width(1826)   -> 2 pass calls of 913 columns
#   step_logits_with_mode(last)      -> 1 pass call + untraced lm_head_fixed_sched
#   cache.insert(tokens, &st.kv)     -> KvState::clone() of 421 MB (56 plane clones)
# The 420.759 ms interval therefore contains:
#   the probes, cold decode_state allocation, the traced greedy head (5.886 ms), the untraced
#   dense lm_head_fixed_sched, the cache insert clone, argmax, checksum and drops.
# Measured: 420.759 ms total, 5.886 ms traced head (1.40%), 414.873 ms unsplit.
# Warm/shared outside = 128 - 66.976 = 61.0 ms and 152 - 66.698 = 85.3 ms, each with 2 clones
# (prefix load + insert), 2 heads (5.561/5.499 ms traced + untraced dense) and 1 eviction.
# Cold decode_state (1 allocation + 55 clones) and cold cache.insert (56 clones) run the same
# 421 MB clone loop before any free, so these turns cannot separate them. The dense head is
# unmeasured and is not bounded by the bitplane head's 5.886 ms. No split is claimed.

